    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=05jCzM9gTWqPUcQj]], each creature in a 30-foot Cone. <em>Failure:</em> The target can't take Reactions until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s next turn, and the target rolls [[/r 1d8]] to determine what it does on its next turn:</p><p><strong>1–4.</strong> The target does nothing.</p><p><strong>5–6.</strong> The target takes no action or Bonus Action and uses all its movement to move in a random direction.</p><p><strong>7–8.</strong> The target makes a melee attack against a random creature within its reach or does nothing if it can't make such an attack.</p>",
